      {%- if section.settings.cred_sub != blank -%}<p class="rd-lede rd-mt1">{{ section.settings.cred_sub }}</p>{%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} ministerial endorsement (verbatim, attributable) — restored 2026-07-22;
         it previously only GATED this band without ever rendering (audit footgun) {%- endcomment -%}
      <blockquote class="rd-pull rd-mt3 rd-reveal">
        <p class="rd-q">{{ section.settings.cred_quote1 }}</p>
        {%- if section.settings.cred_attr1 != blank -%}<cite>{{ section.settings.cred_attr1 }}</cite>{%- endif -%}
      </blockquote>

      {%- comment -%} WHO WE WORK WITH — customer segment + benefit + route.
        Added per Chris Barrett feedback (2026-07): "show who our customer is and how
        they benefit". Pattern borrowed from Bounce Back — address each segment as
        THEIR OWN QUESTION, answer with the benefit, then route. Copy is vault-sourced
        (Education MOC / Corporate MOC / Sales Pitches) — do not invent offers or prices.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign segs = section.blocks | where: "type", "segment" -%}
