      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "story_body_2",
      "label": "Paragraph 2",
      "default": "They earn an OCN Level 2 accreditation in sustainable design and manufacturing. Trusted learners are trained as instructors and help deliver the course. In the final week, frames are taken apart so the materials serve the next cohort — which is also what keeps it affordable."
